# Cursor Rules for unDraw Illustrations (v1.1.0)

When creating UI components that need illustrations (empty states, 404, onboarding, heroes):
1. Run `npx tidjan-undraw smart "<concept>"` to automatically detect brand colors from Tailwind/CSS, rank candidate illustrations, download SVG, and generate components.
2. Anti-duplicate caching is active: existing SVGs are preserved unless `--force` is used.
3. Dark mode adaptation is built-in.
